(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','I can fit you Thursday at two if that works.','TTS','["Thursday at two is fine, thank you.","The registrar is closed today.","I already paid the fee.","Two classrooms, yes."]','A',1,'An offered appointment time is accepted or declined; option A confirms the slot.',51),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','I need a form signed before my advising appointment.','TTS','["I am not sure what a form is.","The office has no chairs.","Bring it to the front desk and I will sign it.","It opened last week."]','C',1,'A request to sign a form fits the reply offering to sign it at the desk.',52),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','The equipment loan desk is on the second floor, do you want directions?','TTS','["It weighs about two kilos.","Yes, please, I have never been there.","Last semester was fine.","No, the test was easy."]','B',1,'An offer of directions is answered by accepting or refusing; option B accepts.',53),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','The micropipette you reserved is still being cleaned, can you come back in an hour?','TTS','["The machine was broken already.","Pipettes come in one size only.","An hour ago, yes.","That is fine, I will return at four."]','D',1,'A request to return later fits an answer that accepts the delay.',54),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','Could I see your campus ID, please?','TTS','["Of course, here it is.","Here is the lab report.","It was built last year.","Yes, the door is open."]','A',1,'A polite request for the ID is met by presenting it.',55),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','You left your bicycle by the fire lane overnight.','TTS','["Bicycles have two wheels.","The fire is on the third floor.","Sorry, I will move it right away.","I bought it in spring."]','C',1,'Being told the bike is misplaced calls for an apology and a plan to move it.',56),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','Special-collections items cannot leave the reading room, will that be a problem?','TTS','["A reading room has tables.","No, I can work on them here.","I visited last month.","Yes, I printed the list."]','B',1,'The question asks whether the rule is a problem, so the answer addresses working on-site.',57),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','Do you need the microfilm reader or the original tablet?','TTS','["Tablets are heavy.","Microfilm arrived last year.","Yes, I have a card.","The original if that is allowed."]','D',1,'An either-or question is answered by choosing one option.',58),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','How did the lunch buffet turn out for you?','TTS','["It was good, though the soup was salty.","A buffet holds many trays.","I ate at noon.","Lunch starts at eleven."]','A',1,'A how-question about a meal expects an evaluation of it.',59),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','Would you fill out this short feedback card?','TTS','["Cards are usually white.","I do not like soup.","Sure, it should only take a minute.","The table is by the window."]','C',1,'A request for a favor is answered by agreeing or declining.',60),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','Your roommate change is ready, do you want to sign tonight?','TTS','["Rooms usually have two beds.","I can stop by tomorrow instead.","The key is in my bag.","Yes, the hall is quiet."]','B',1,'An offer to sign tonight fits an answer proposing a different day.',61),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','The new building assigns parking by lottery, is that okay with you?','TTS','["Cars need parking spaces.","I have a car already.","Yes, it rained last night.","That is fine, I hope I get a spot."]','D',1,'The is-that-okay question calls for an opinion about the lottery.',62),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','Have you finished the course plan we discussed?','TTS','["Almost, I need two more courses.","Plans are printed online.","I have discussed it before.","No, the exam was last week."]','A',1,'A have-you-finished question asks about progress on the plan.',63),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','The centrifuge is booked all afternoon, can you wait until tomorrow?','TTS','["Centrifuges spin very fast.","I booked two hours.","Tomorrow morning would work.","The lab closes on Sunday."]','C',1,'A request to wait fits an answer accepting a new time.',64),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','Did you notice anyone in the hallway after midnight?','TTS','["The hallway is long.","No, the corridor was empty.","Midnight is usually dark.","Yes, I locked my door."]','B',1,'A did-you-notice question about the hallway is answered with who, or no one, was there.',65),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','May I ask which collection you are researching?','TTS','["Collections sit on shelves.","The archive opened at nine.","I research on weekends.","I am looking at early ration tablets."]','D',1,'A which-collection question asks for the topic being studied.',66),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','Your security report has been filed, do you need a copy?','TTS','["Yes, please email it to me.","Reports use long forms.","The report desk is closed.","I filed it last week."]','A',1,'An offer of a copy is answered by accepting or declining.',67),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_RESPONSE','Listen to the sentence and choose the best response.','The advising appointment got moved to the small study room.','TTS','["Study rooms have whiteboards.","I had an appointment earlier.","Thanks, I will check the door sign.","The adviser is on leave."]','C',1,'Being told a room has changed calls for an acknowledgement and a plan to find it.',68),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Student: I missed the advising slot on Thursday because my shift ran late. — Advisor: No problem, the next open appointment is Tuesday morning, but you must send your course draft first. — Student: Got it, I will email the draft tonight.','TTS','["Find a Thursday slot","Cancel the appointment","Send her course draft","Extend her work shift"]','C',1,'The advisor says she must send the course draft before the Tuesday appointment.',69),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Student: I missed the advising slot on Thursday because my shift ran late. — Advisor: No problem, the next open appointment is Tuesday morning, but you must send your course draft first. — Student: Got it, I will email the draft tonight.','TTS','["Her work shift ran late","She forgot the day","The office was closed","The adviser was away"]','A',1,'The student states that her work shift ran late, causing the miss.',70),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Student: I missed the advising slot on Thursday because my shift ran late. — Advisor: No problem, the next open appointment is Tuesday morning, but you must send your course draft first. — Student: Got it, I will email the draft tonight.','TTS','["Thursday night","Next week online","Tomorrow afternoon","Tuesday morning"]','D',1,'The advisor offers Tuesday morning as the next open slot.',71),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Student: I reserved the balance scale for my report, but I do not know how to reset it. — Lab worker: Press the zero button and let it settle, and if the display keeps jumping, come back and I will check the battery.','TTS','["Press the zero button and wait","Swap the battery right away","Hand over the scale","Rewrite the report"]','A',1,'The first step the worker gives is to press zero and let it settle.',72),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Student: I reserved the balance scale for my report, but I do not know how to reset it. — Lab worker: Press the zero button and let it settle, and if the display keeps jumping, come back and I will check the battery.','TTS','["Restart the whole machine","Submit the report online","Return and have the battery checked","Put the scale away"]','C',1,'The worker says to come back so the battery can be checked if the display keeps jumping.',73),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Student: I reserved the balance scale for my report, but I do not know how to reset it. — Lab worker: Press the zero button and let it settle, and if the display keeps jumping, come back and I will check the battery.','TTS','["It is usually impossible to use","It may have a battery problem","It is missing from the lab","It cannot record a report"]','B',1,'The worker mentions checking the battery, so a battery problem is a known possibility.',74),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Officer: Someone reported a bicycle missing from the east rack this morning. — Student: That was mine, I locked it with a cable around 9:00. — Officer: Then write your frame number here, and I will search the lot where towed bikes go.','TTS','["Move another bicycle","Buy a new lock","Ride to the east rack","Provide the frame number"]','D',1,'The officer asks the student to write down the bicycle frame number.',75),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Officer: Someone reported a bicycle missing from the east rack this morning. — Student: That was mine, I locked it with a cable around 9:00. — Officer: Then write your frame number here, and I will search the lot where towed bikes go.','TTS','["At the lot this evening","Around 9:00 this morning","Late last night","Yesterday afternoon"]','B',1,'The student says she locked the bicycle with a cable around nine in the morning.',76),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Officer: Someone reported a bicycle missing from the east rack this morning. — Student: That was mine, I locked it with a cable around 9:00. — Officer: Then write your frame number here, and I will search the lot where towed bikes go.','TTS','["The lecture hall","The bike shop","The lot for towed bicycles","The east rack only"]','C',1,'The officer plans to search the lot where towed bicycles are sent.',77),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Researcher: I want to photograph the old ration tablets in special collections. — Librarian: Cameras are allowed, but the flash must be off and no staff member may move the items for you. — Researcher: Understood, I will bring my own stand.','TTS','["Borrow the tablets","Move the items herself","Photograph the tablets","Use the flash freely"]','C',1,'The librarian says cameras are allowed, so photographing the tablets is permitted.',78),
(@set05_exam_id,'LISTENING','LISTEN_CONVERSATION','Listen to the conversation and answer the question.','Researcher: I want to photograph the old ration tablets in special collections. — Librarian: Cameras are allowed, but the flash must be off and no staff member may move the items for you. — Researcher: Understood, I will bring my own stand.','TTS','["The researcher must buy a tripod","The flash must be turned off","Only the cover may be shot","A staff member must hold the tablet"]','B',1,'The librarian permits cameras only if the flash is kept off.',79),
